release docs). Until then, test on the owner's own phone.{% else %}Decide with the owner at the "Go live" milestone, following the engineering playbook.{% endif %}{% endif %}

## 7. Finish
Tick Milestone 0 in PROGRESS.md, commit on a branch, open the PR, and tell the owner in plain words:
